ec6e22d32dcc2fcdb920cf13b0436","supports":["licenses.code"],"url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/socai-io/socai/7bafd783fe0a3d03ee0098bf1ba3415d62e7967f/LICENSE"},{"method":"license_header","retrieved_at":"2026-10-18T15:48:22Z","role":"primary","sha256":"e3c589e788200c12f2e325071bcc7602a49ec6e22d32dcc2fcdb920cf13b0436","supports":["licenses.code"],"url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/socai-io/socai/HEAD/LICENSE"}],"id":"github:socai-io/socai","identifiers":{},"kind":"tool","last_verified_at":"2026-10-18T15:48:16Z","licenses":{"code":{"basis":"repository LICENSE header; not a weights/data license","declared":"Apache-2.0","retrieved_at":"2026-10-18T15:48:22Z","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/socai-io/socai/HEAD/LICENSE"},"data":null,"document":null,"weights":null},"links":[{"rel":"primary","url":"https://github.com/socai-io/socai"}],"name":"socai","notes":"Adjacent: models call fixed site operations (search, open posts and profiles, expand comments, OCR images, transcribe video, and a few write actions such as comments and replies on Xiaohongshu, X, Instagram and LinkedIn). Covered sites are Xiaohongshu, Douyin, TikTok, Instagram, LinkedIn, X and WeChat Official Account articles; podcast commands read an indexed library without a browser. core/src/cdp connects to Chrome or Edge through the DevTools Protocol and performs paced navigation, clicks and scrolling, with per-site page scripts under core/src/sites; Firefox and Safari backends are documented as not implemented. The desktop app runs its own tool-calling agent loop (core/src/agent) with OpenAI or Anthropic models, and the CLI installs a Skill for hosts such as Codex and Claude Code.","published_at":null,"relations":[],"review_status":"curated","scope":"adjacent","summary":"Rust CLI, Agent Skill and desktop research agent that drive a signed-in Chrome over the DevTools Protocol with per-platform tools for searching and reading posts, comments and profiles on social sites.","topics":["web-navigation","automation"],"updated_at":null,"url":"https://github.com/socai-io/socai"}
